    <data key="d0">Genomics Processing Pipeline on AWS</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=53sUjFv9ByI</data>
    <data key="d2">Architecture for scalable genomic data processing using EC2, FSx, ECR, EKS, and S3 Data Lake.</data>
